<title>USA: TABLE - Davox Corp Q2 share rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Davox Corp Q2 share rises.</headline>
<dateline>WESTFORD, Mass. 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF INCOME</p>
<p>			     (UNAUDITED)</p>
<p>		  For the three months   For the six months</p>
<p>		     ended June 30,	   ended June 30,</p>
<p>			 1997	   1996	  1997	  1996</p>
<p>Total revenue</p>
<p>		  18,170,179   12,665,349  35,438,910  24,075,616</p>
<p> Net Income    4,075,128    2,047,861   7,960,385   3,806,160</p>
<p>Net income per common and</p>
<p>common equivalent</p>
<p>  share		 0.32	   0.17	  0.63	  0.31</p>
<p>Weighted average number of common</p>
<p>and common equivalent shares</p>
<p>outstanding    12,620,612   12,290,256  12,540,657  12,151,901</p>
<p>Estimated fully taxed</p>
<p>net income per common</p>
<p>and common equivalent</p>
<p>share (assuming 38%</p>
<p>  tax rate)	   0.23	   0.11	  0.45	  0.22</p>
<p>NOTE: Share and per share amounts for all periods presented reflect the 3 for 2 stock split of May 1997.</p>
<p>((---New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
